{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Fixed teaching scenarios with scripted transcripts. Each scenario declares evidence_keys (the cited page must contain them), claim_terms (the explanation must state them), quiz_keywords (a diagnostic must be relevant), forbidden claims and quality (good / medium / flawed / bypass). Six good, four medium (single-signal ablations), three flawed and three exam-style bypass samples. The offline rubric is deterministic; it verifies citations and next-step executability rather than trusting surface keywords.",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "concept-1",
      "category": "concept",
      "title": "顺序表按位序访问为什么是 O(1)",
      "student_context": "学生刚学完线性表，问按位序访问的代价。",
      "transcript": [
        {
          "actor": "agent",
          "action": "quiz",
          "text": "先测一下：顺序表访问第 i 个元素需要从头遍历吗？"
        },
        {
          "actor": "student",
          "action": "answer",
          "text": "学生：应该不用吧，感觉是直接算地址。"
        },
        {
          "actor": "agent",
          "action": "explain",
          "text": "不需要。顺序表的元素在内存中连续存放，地址可以直接算出来，所以是 O(1)（第1章_线性表.md p.1）。"
        },
        {
          "actor": "agent",
          "action": "next",
          "text": "📍 下一步：examprep quiz -n 1"
        }
      ],
      "evidence_keys": [
        "按位序访问第 i 个元素：O(1)"
      ],
      "forbidden": [],
      "quality": "good",
      "claim_terms": [
        "顺序表",
        "O(1)"
      ],
      "quiz_keywords": [
        "顺序表",
        "按位序",
        "遍历"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concept-2",
      "category": "concept",
      "title": "循环队列为什么牺牲一个单元判满",
      "student_context": "学生不理解循环队列判满为什么要留一个空位。",
      "transcript": [
        {
          "actor": "agent",
          "action": "quiz",
          "text": "先判断：循环队列判空和判满都用 front == rear 会怎样？"
        },
        {
          "actor": "student",
          "action": "answer",
          "text": "学生：如果都用 front == rear，就分不清空和满了。"
        },
        {
          "actor": "agent",
          "action": "explain",
          "text": "如果判空和判满都用 front == rear，就无法区分空和满。牺牲一个单元后，判满条件是 (rear + 1) % MaxSize == front（第2章_栈和队列.md p.1）。"
        },
        {
          "actor": "agent",
          "action": "next",
          "text": "📍 下一步：examprep quiz --review"
        }
      ],
      "evidence_keys": [
        "(rear + 1) % MaxSize == front"
      ],
      "forbidden": [],
      "quality": "good",
      "claim_terms": [
        "(rear + 1) % MaxSize == front"
      ],
      "quiz_keywords": [
        "循环队列",
        "判空",
        "判满"
      ]
    },
